@startuml
' bt-view-kind: context
' bt-view-id: mcp-server:system-context
title MCP Server - Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: client
' bt-element-id: server
' bt-element-id: backend
' bt-element-id: world

actor "MCP Client\nResponsibility: Discover and invoke Better Tomorrow tools\nContract: JSON-RPC over stdio\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/README.md source]]" as client
rectangle "MCP Server\nResponsibility: Validate protocol and dispatch registered capabilities\nContract: MCP JSON-RPC\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/server.py source]]" as server
rectangle "Backend\nResponsibility: Authorize and execute platform mutations\nContract: Authenticated backend API\n[[../../../../backend/app/api/v1/__init__.py source]]" as backend
rectangle "World Engine\nResponsibility: Expose safe session inspection and commands\nContract: Runtime API\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/api/http.py source]]" as world

server ..> backend : "delegates mutation\ncontract: backend authority and audit\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/backend_client.py source]]"
server ..> world : "inspects session\ncontract: safe runtime surface\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/handlers/tools_registry_handlers_backend_session.py source]]"
client ..> server : "invokes capability\ncontract: valid MCP JSON-RPC\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/server.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: context
Concern: Protocol adapter boundary against domain authorities
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
